WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:01.889
Back in March, Twitter suspended the

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.539
account of the massively popular

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.489
Christian satire site The Babylon

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:07.319
Bee after it awarded "Man

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.269
of the Year" honors to Rachel

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.099
Levine, a transwoman serving in

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.419
the Biden administration's

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.799
Department of Health and Human

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.599
Services who had been named one of

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.459
USA Today's "Women of

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.079
the Year." The Babylon Bee's editor

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.939
in chief, Kyle Mann, says that

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.799
the article was intended to satirize

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.419
media treatment of identity

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.579
politics, not demean trans

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.149
people.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.099
We love trans people and we love

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.869
you know, we don't we don't consider

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.809
people like that beneath us.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.659
You know, the Christian worldview is

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:35.609
that everybody everybody has the

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.049
opportunity to be saved, you know,

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.249
and we can love everybody.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.929
And I'm no more deserving of God's

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.999
grace than a transgender person.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.949
But when the culture

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.569
bows down and starts handing out

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.979
trophies to people for stuff like

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:47.969
this, that's when we say, 'Hey, wait

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.099
a minute, we need to protect women

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.569
in our society as well.'

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.069
The Bee's Twitter account remains

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.599
locked because the publication

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.759
steadfastly refuses to delete

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.049
the tweet and acknowledge it

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.969
contravened Twitter's policy against

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:01.679
hate speech in response to the

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.449
Twitter ban and persistent

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.339
demonetization and minimizing of

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.569
the reach of its content at

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:08.369
Facebook, the Bee has created its

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.469
own social network and subscription

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.639
model, both of which are

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:12.449
flourishing.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.159
The episode shines a light on how

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.139
contemporary culture wars are waged

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.059
online and illustrates the

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.889
specific travails that

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.019
evangelical Christians face

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:23.609
in a country that is increasingly

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.829
secular and socially liberal.

00:01:25.830 --> 00:01:27.299
Reason caught up with Mann at

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.129
Freedom Fest, the annual gathering

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:30.899
in Las Vegas, to talk about why he

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.849
loves making fun of Donald Trump

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:34.889
and Joe Biden, but saves his deepest

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.869
burns for megachurch pastors such

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:37.859
as Joel Osteen.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.539
Why he believes that the left and

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.549
Gen Z can't deal with humor

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:43.289
that makes fun of them and why he

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.179
loves personal liberty and personal

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.739
freedom, even if it creates a

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:48.929
culture that is deeply hostile

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:49.930
to his faith.

